flowchart LR
    accTitle: Direct mode versus API mode
    accDescr: In direct mode the caller imports the other package and calls its functions in the same process. In API mode the caller sends HTTP requests to a deployed copy of that service.
    A["Caller"] --> Q{"CLIENT_MODE"}
    Q -- "direct (default)" --> F["import and call<br>in the same process"]
    Q -- "api" --> HTTP["HTTP to a deployed service<br>(host from env)"]
